{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Bob's Island! Wake up stranded on a mysterious island, full of magical secrets and strange monsters. Explore, gather resources, and fight your way across the island, defeating epic bosses and crafting powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hundreds of unique items, an expansive skill tree, customizable weapon abilities and traits, and intense bullet hell bosses,\u00a0Bob's Island is an expansive indie survival game with a focus on interesting build variety and challenging combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight Epic Bullet Hell Bosses</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against over 30 intense and challenging bullet hell boss fights, from simple slimes to giant abyssal demons, test your skill against this onslaught of challenging foes, and be rewarded with powerful weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/67394153ab20fbcca9288ae83b0c3def.poster.avif?t=1761239617\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/67394153ab20fbcca9288ae83b0c3def.webm?t=1761239617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/67394153ab20fbcca9288ae83b0c3def.mp4?t=1761239617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/98015a11d6d954775b10c18844222b09.poster.avif?t=1761239617\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/98015a11d6d954775b10c18844222b09.webm?t=1761239617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/98015a11d6d954775b10c18844222b09.mp4?t=1761239617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore an Expansive Skill Tree</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your playstyle and evolve your abilities through a large and customizable skill tree, allowing for a wide variety of builds and loadouts to fit any playstyle, featuring dozens of unique abilities and stat improvements of all kinds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/27b6cadb84d1975e0759fa55e16061d6.avif?t=1761239617\" width=992 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customize Your Equipment</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize hundreds of unique items to survive on the island. Featuring a unique weapon customization system through Runes and Weapon Skills that allows every weapon to feel dynamic and personalized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/c19250fde2eb7d0bba1a3f8d5a6f8b4b.poster.avif?t=1761239617\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/c19250fde2eb7d0bba1a3f8d5a6f8b4b.webm?t=1761239617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/c19250fde2eb7d0bba1a3f8d5a6f8b4b.mp4?t=1761239617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/82a3842f7b0cdbaf16271da7000ea4da.poster.avif?t=1761239617\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/82a3842f7b0cdbaf16271da7000ea4da.webm?t=1761239617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/82a3842f7b0cdbaf16271da7000ea4da.mp4?t=1761239617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon comes equipped with a powerful ability that customizes its move set and can be changed and swapped at a skill table.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962770?t=1761239617","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/e9fae1d0bfd1b079b593844e440e3e7612c5e6c5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761239617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/3330e770c37a04d91460c09a4c3140d96e7d5c7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761239617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/3330e770c37a04d91460c09a4c3140d96e7d5c7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761239617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Bob's Island! Wake up stranded on a mysterious island, full of magical secrets and strange monsters. Explore, gather resources, and fight your way across the island, defeating epic bosses and crafting powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"b